# Task 13 — Successful login

The request used the same temporary credentials from Task 12. The password and returned JWT are not stored; the actual successful response is shown with only its token redacted.

Actual cURL request:

```sh
curl -fsS -X POST "$BASE_URL/api/secondchance/auth/login" \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d "$(jq -nc --arg email "$TEST_EMAIL" --arg password "$TEST_PASSWORD" '{email:$email,password:$password}')"
```

